WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The wise say that waters once covered most of the world...

2
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:15.980
Endless was the ocean, and the Gibberlings traveled across it, free and proud.

3
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:24.800
But there are monsters in the deep abyss, and one of the most insidious among them was Lyngbakr.

4
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:31.500
This fish was huge, and when it surfaced, its back was like an island!

5
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.500
But woe to those who landed on it...

6
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:41.240
Sensing the living, Lyngbakr plunged into the abyss, then devoured his drowning victims!
